  "changes": [
    "File/eval entries compose the canonical existing script installer rather than installing a bare executable name.",
    "Ordinary output no longer diverts file-backed children to source parsing; remove the hard-coded JSON.stringify(process.execArgv) shortcut and its source-branch discriminator.",
    "Direct, shell, and spawnSync boundaries execute the requested command without substituting diagnostic launchers.",
    "CLI completion preserves RunOutcome exit status for both file and eval.",
    "process.exitCode and process.exit share safe-integer validation, signed 32-bit field storage and coded errors; an unset field reads undefined. Remove the unused saturating value_to_i32 helper."
  ],
